# Beat (week 1, Wednesday) — late-night texts with the sibling drifting.
# cast.md § 3.2: "Late-night text conversations with the player about
# nothing — and underneath, everything." Short sentences, humor, deflection.
# TODO: authenticity check

Eleven-forty. Your phone lights up the ceiling.
sibling: what was the cereal grandma used to buy. the one with the bear on the box
sibling: its been bugging me for like an hour
- Tell him.
	[signal arg="BUMP:sibling_close"]
	You tell him. He sends back a row of exclamation points, then nothing for a while.
	sibling: u still up
	sibling: nvm. night
- "Go to sleep, {GameState.sibling_name}."
	sibling: yes mom
	sibling: jk. night
You lie awake a while after, the phone face-down on your chest.
